  "title": "OWHS BenefitUtilisation v0.2",
  "description": "Producer-held aggregate event counts. This is not an employer-output record: use an AggregateReport and the privacy profile for disclosure. Counts below a reporting floor can be structurally valid here. Claim contents and individual attendance are excluded.",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
